
[TestRequireAsyncDisposable/invalid-0 - 1]
Diagnostic 1: mustExtend (8:7 - 8:13)
Message: Class must extend ADisposable: it owns the AbortController and the in-flight set.
Help: Extend ADisposable, or a class that already does.
